## Context

Child of epic 0061. Each regime needs a model set with appropriate
capabilities. After 0063 adds the flags, this ticket creates the
sets in experiments.toml.

## Actions

1. `sets.ablation_parametric`: frontier models with reasoning
   (o3, R1, Claude Opus, GPT-5.4, DeepSeek V3.2, Qwen3 Max)
2. `sets.ablation_rag`: top 5 RAG performers from existing data
   (DeepSeek V3.2, GPT-5.4, Mistral Large, Gemini Flash, Claude Opus)
3. `sets.ablation_websearch`: models with web_search + reasoning
4. `sets.ablation_core`: intersection present in all 3 regimes
   (enables clean 3-way regime comparison)
5. Update ablation sweep configs to reference new sets

## Exit criteria
- 4 model sets defined in experiments.toml
- ablation_core has >= 3 models testable in all 3 regimes
- Sweep configs updated for 3 regimes x 16 prompts
